FakeNames←{
⍝ A fake name for each name in ⍵, word by word. Spaces and hyphens are kept and
⍝ every word keeps its length, so the parser sees the same shapes: it pads merged
⍝ multi-instructor fields to the longest name, so lengths change its output.
    0=≢⍵:⍬
    words←∪⊃,/{⍵⊆⍨~⍵∊' -'}¨⍵
    fakes←FakeWords words
    {('[^ \-]+'⎕R{fakes⊃⍨words⍳⊂⍵.Match})⍵}¨⍵
}
